#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:190
msgid "Sets the zoom level on the Gantt chart. 'Hour' shows a range of several hours, 'Day' shows a range of a few days, 'Week' shows a range of a few months, and 'Month' shows a range of a few years, while 'Automatic' selects the range most appropriate for the current event or to-do."
msgstr "Mengeset aras zum pada carta Gantt. 'Jam' memaparkan julat beberapa jam, 'Hari' memaparkan julat beberapa hari, 'Minggu' memaparkan julat beberapa bulan, dan 'Bulan' memaparkan julat untuk beberapa tahun, manakala 'Automatik' memilih julat paling sesuai untuk peristiwa dan tugasan semasa."

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:197
msgid "Scale: "
msgstr "Skala:"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:203
