#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:213
msgid "Center on Start"
msgstr "Pusatkan pada Pemulaan"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:215
msgid "Centers the Gantt chart on the start time and day of this event."
msgstr "Memusatkan carta Gantt pada  waktu  pemulaan dan hari peristiwa berlaku."

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:220
msgid "Zoom to Fit"
msgstr "Zum kepada Padan"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:222
msgid "Zooms the Gantt chart so that you can see the entire duration of the event on it."
msgstr "Menzum carta Gantt supaya anda dapat melihat tempoh seluruh peritiwa di dalamnya."

